review_text:
The Gayme is basically Chinese Genshit Cumpact, but simutaneously more AND less Ambition than that crap

Cuz it's too busy tryina be Genshit Souls-packed-up-yer-ass;
The balance is total shet, cuz at 1st, the gayme starts off plenty easy enough to navigate battle, even against 3-5 targets at 1 time;
But by the time you're nearly done with the 1st Act of the MQ the gayme FORGETS it's tryina be shit souls, & has you facing off against 5 enemies & 2 minibosses at the same time, multiple times in the MQ Scenario, then has you basically fighting the Bloodwitch Demon reimagining of Freja from Shit Souls 3, whom is the 2nd hardest "normal" Boss (i.e. not some giant monster, dragon, rot root, or some other whack shaz) in all of Shitazaki's GAYmes untill Armored Shitcore 6;
so Act 1 of the MQ isn't even BEATABLE, cuz you have to get past a literally IMPOSSIBLE to beat Shitten Ring calibur Boss before you even have enough shit in the game to have a Build that's even STRONG enough to fight a Boss at that level, let alone actually fucking WIN!

& yes, they HAVE technically already broken their promise, as there's BPs, Gotcha!s & other shat that give Mat.s that ARE in limited Supply otherwise, for Gearing up, shet in the Shop to give you more Potion Slots;
(in this shitty game, you don't even have a fucking "Estus Flask", so all your basic Healing is EXPENDABLE & hard asf to come by, other than the basic Potion-like item, & that bitch gets hella expensive with how much & how often you ARE gonna have to restock that bitch)

Bosses don't teligraph most of their moves & can hit you with 5-8 hit Combos that will ALWAYS Tide-lock (Stun-lock) you to the ENTIRE gdm Combo, & those combos are so hella fucking overpowered that the Boss can basically pull a Blade & Soul an Tech-chase you with them to 1-fucking-Combo yer ass with stupidly insulting levels of ease

Bosses are also prone to not really reacting much (or if the glitch kicks in, requiring a Relog from the Title Screen) don't react at ALL to Qi (Poise) Damaging Affects from Mystic Arts & Martial Skills

A.I. Allies are mostly useless most of the time, & while they did make Killerblade basically Essential, & he does try really hard to keep that scythe bitch off yer ass, he's not even IN the 2nd round of the Boss fight at the end of MQ Act 1;
... & that is when you need him the most, as the scythe bitch goes Freja Round 3 Mode (from Dark Souls 3's DLC) & hits you with 7-9! hit fucking Combos that CAN'T be broken by Parrying;
.. .. (yes, you read that right, Combos from Bosses are NOT broken by PARRYING the shit like in Miyazaki Shit Souls Gaymes);
... .. So the bitch gets to cheese you all gdm day & you can't do shit, as you get to have a measly 2, just fucking 2! Healing Items in yer Active Slot in Combat, no more, without the fucking Premium Membershit, making it VERY Pay2Win in that regard
(in Soulsborne ANYTHING, Healing is Life, Healing is victory, so with it being fucking PAYWALLED, yeah, DEFINITELY pay to fucking win)
